          <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-950 mb-1 uppercase">Three Everyday Characteristics:</h4>
          <ul class="text-xs text-slate-900 space-y-1.5 pl-4 list-disc font-medium">
            <li><strong>On-Demand</strong>: Start or stop computers anytime without asking for permission.</li>
            <li><strong>Elastic</strong>: Automatically stretch to handle busy traffic and shrink when quiet.</li>
            <li><strong>Pay for Usage</strong>: Pay only for the exact seconds of CPU and gigabytes of storage you use.</li>
